# Everything runs on a local model through Ollama; no API key is needed (DECISIONS.md 4 and 10).
# Start Ollama first: `ollama serve` (or `brew services start ollama` to start it at login).

# Optional overrides. Write the model the plain Ollama way; each build adds its framework's prefix.
# MODEL=qwen3:8b
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
